# Map manager command.
#   list                       → maps, active
#   save                       serialize the active map now
#   save_as  name              copy the current map under a new name and make it active
#   load     name [pose]       restart SLAM from a stored map at pose (x, y, theta) or its last pose
#   new                        start a fresh map (auto-named)
#   set_pose pose              the robot was carried: restart SLAM on the active map at pose (x, y, theta)
#   delete   name              remove a stored map (not the active one)
string command
string name
float64[] pose
---
bool success
string message
string[] maps
string active
